<section class="page-hero shell admin-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Administración</span><h1>Usuarios y acceso.</h1><p>Vista protegida por rol Admin. Las contraseñas nunca se exponen en esta pantalla.</p></section>
<section class="admin-layout shell">
    <div class="admin-panel">
        <div class="section-heading compact"><div><span class="eyebrow">Usuarios</span><h2>Cuentas registradas</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/apidocs">API Docs ↗</a></div>
        <div class="user-table-wrap"><table class="user-table"><thead><tr><th>Nombre</th><th>Email</th><th>Rol</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each users}}<tr><td>{{this.first_name}} {{this.last_name}}</td><td>{{this.email}}</td><td><span class="role-badge role-{{this.isAdmin}}">{{this.isAdmin}}</span></td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="3">No hay usuarios para mostrar.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="admin-create"><span class="eyebrow">Nuevo administrador</span><h2>Crear acceso.</h2><form data-api-form data-endpoint="/api/session/admin/register" data-no-redirect><label>Nombre<input name="first_name" required></label><label>Apellido<input name="last_name" required></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>Contraseña<input type="password" name="password" minlength="6" required></label><button class="button button-primary button-wide" type="submit">Crear admin</button><p class="form-status" data-form-status></p></form></aside>
</section>
